l":"̶O̶ ̶P̶R̶E̶S̶I̶D̶E̶N̶T̶E̶ ̶D̶A̶ ̶R̶E̶P̶Ú̶B̶L̶I̶C̶A̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶t̶r̶i̶b̶u̶i̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶l̶h̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶f̶e̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶8̶4̶,̶ <em>̶c̶a̶p̶u̶t̶</em>,̶ ̶i̶n̶c̶i̶s̶o̶ ̶V̶I̶,̶ ̶a̶l̶í̶n̶e̶a̶ ̶“̶a̶”̶,̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶t̶i̶t̶u̶i̶ç̶ã̶o̶,̶ ̶e̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-8","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"C̶o̶n̶s̶i̶d̶e̶r̶a̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶o̶ ̶A̶c̶o̶r̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶p̶e̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶T̶é̶c̶n̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ ̶f̶i̶r̶m̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶F̶u̶n̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶B̶a̶n̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶B̶r̶a̶s̶i̶l̶,̶","html":"C̶o̶n̶s̶i̶d̶e̶r̶a̶n̶d̶o̶ ̶o̶ ̶A̶c̶o̶r̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶p̶e̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶T̶é̶c̶n̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ ̶f̶i̶r̶m̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶F̶u̶n̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶B̶a̶n̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶B̶r̶a̶s̶i̶l̶,̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-9","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"D̶E̶C̶R̶E̶T̶A̶:̶","html":"D̶E̶C̶R̶E̶T̶A̶:̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-10","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶F̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶i̶n̶s̶t̶i̶t̶u̶í̶d̶o̶ ̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶,̶ ̶v̶i̶n̶c̶u̶l̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶a̶c̶o̶r̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶o̶p̶e̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶t̶é̶c̶n̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶c̶e̶l̶e̶b̶r̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶e̶ ̶F̶u̶n̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶B̶a̶n̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶B̶r̶a̶s̶i̶l̶.̶","html":"<strong>A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶.̶º̶ ̶</strong> ̶F̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶i̶n̶s̶t̶i̶t̶u̶í̶d̶o̶ ̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶,̶ ̶v̶i̶n̶c̶u̶l̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶a̶c̶o̶r̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶o̶p̶e̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶t̶é̶c̶n̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶c̶e̶l̶e̶b̶r̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶e̶ ̶F̶u̶n̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶B̶a̶n̶c̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶B̶r̶a̶s̶i̶l̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-11","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶2̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶e̶m̶ ̶o̶ ̶o̶b̶j̶e̶t̶i̶v̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶o̶r̶i̶e̶n̶t̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶c̶u̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶f̶i̶n̶a̶n̶c̶i̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶d̶o̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶f̶i̶n̶a̶n̶c̶e̶i̶r̶a̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶t̶i̶n̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶e̶n̶f̶r̶e̶n̶t̶a̶m̶e̶n̶t̶o̶ ̶à̶ ̶c̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶e̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶e̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶m̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶i̶s̶p̶o̶s̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶L̶e̶g̶i̶s̶l̶a̶t̶i̶v̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶6̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶m̶a̶r̶ç̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶0̶.̶","html":"<strong>A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶2̶.̶º̶</strong> ̶ ̶O̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶e̶m̶ ̶o̶ ̶o̶b̶j̶e̶t̶i̶v̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶o̶r̶i̶e̶n̶t̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶c̶u̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶f̶i̶n̶a̶n̶c̶i̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶d̶o̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶f̶i̶n̶a̶n̶c̶e̶i̶r̶a̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶t̶i̶n̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶e̶n̶f̶r̶e̶n̶t̶a̶m̶e̶n̶t̶o̶ ̶à̶ ̶c̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶e̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶e̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶m̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶i̶s̶p̶o̶s̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶L̶e̶g̶i̶s̶l̶a̶t̶i̶v̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶6̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶m̶a̶r̶ç̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶0̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-12","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶3̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶é̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶p̶o̶s̶t̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶r̶e̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶t̶a̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶g̶u̶i̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶ó̶r̶g̶ã̶o̶s̶:̶ ̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶d̶o̶i̶s̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶,̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶q̶u̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶r̶á̶;̶ ̶II̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶J̶u̶s̶t̶i̶ç̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶S̶e̶g̶u̶r̶a̶n̶ç̶a̶ ̶P̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶;̶ ̶̶I̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶D̶e̶f̶e̶s̶a̶;̶ ̶̶I̶V̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶o̶m̶i̶a̶;̶ ̶V̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶E̶d̶u̶c̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶;̶ ̶V̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶d̶a̶d̶a̶n̶i̶a̶;̶ ̶V̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶S̶a̶ú̶d̶e̶;̶ ̶̶V̶I̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶u̶n̶i̶c̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶;̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶R̶e̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶ ̶I̶X̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶,̶ ̶T̶e̶c̶n̶o̶l̶o̶g̶i̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶I̶n̶o̶v̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶;̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶R̶e̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶ ̶X̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶s̶e̶n̶v̶o̶l̶v̶i̶m̶e̶n̶t̶o̶ ̶R̶e̶g̶i̶o̶n̶a̶l̶;̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶R̶e̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶ ̶X̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶M̶u̶l̶h̶e̶r̶,̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶F̶a̶m̶í̶l̶i̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶D̶i̶r̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶H̶u̶m̶a̶n̶o̶s̶;̶ ̶e̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶R̶e̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶ ̶X̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶S̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶a̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶G̶o̶v̶e̶r̶n̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶.̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶I̶n̶c̶l̶u̶í̶d̶o̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶","html":"<strong>A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶3̶.̶º̶</strong> ̶ ̶O̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶é̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶p̶o̶s̶t̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶r̶e̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶t̶a̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶g̶u̶i̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶ó̶r̶g̶ã̶o̶s̶:̶<br>\n̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶d̶o̶i̶s̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶,̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶q̶u̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶r̶á̶;̶<br>\n̶II̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶J̶u̶s̶t̶i̶ç̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶S̶e̶g̶u̶r̶a̶n̶ç̶a̶ ̶P̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶;̶<br>\n̶̶I̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶D̶e̶f̶e̶s̶a̶;̶<br>\n̶̶I̶V̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶o̶m̶i̶a̶;̶<br>\n̶V̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶E̶d̶u̶c̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶;̶<br>\n̶V̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶d̶a̶d̶a̶n̶i̶a̶;̶<br>\n̶V̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶S̶a̶ú̶d̶e̶;̶<br>\n̶̶V̶I̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶u̶n̶i̶c̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶;̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶R̶e̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶<br>\n̶I̶X̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶,̶ ̶T̶e̶c̶n̶o̶l̶o̶g̶i̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶I̶n̶o̶v̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶;̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶R̶e̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶<br>\n̶X̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶s̶e̶n̶v̶o̶l̶v̶i̶m̶e̶n̶t̶o̶ ̶R̶e̶g̶i̶o̶n̶a̶l̶;̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶R̶e̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶<br>\n̶X̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶é̶r̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶M̶u̶l̶h̶e̶r̶,̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶F̶a̶m̶í̶l̶i̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶D̶i̶r̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶H̶u̶m̶a̶n̶o̶s̶;̶ ̶e̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶R̶e̶d̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶<br>\n̶X̶I̶I̶ ̶-̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶S̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶a̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶G̶o̶v̶e̶r̶n̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶.̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶ ̶(̶I̶n̶c̶l̶u̶í̶d̶o̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶D̶e̶c̶r̶e̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶1̶0̶.̶6̶4̶2̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶1̶)̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-13","kind":"annotation","tag":"p","text":"Redação anterior:","html":"<strong>Redação anterior:</strong>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-14","kind":"annotation","tag":"p","text":"\"VIII - um do Ministério de Estado da Ciência, Tecnologia, Inovações e Comunicações;\"","html":"\"<em>VIII - um do Ministério de Estado da Ciência, Tecnologia, Inovações e Comunicações</em>;\"","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-15","kind":"annotation","tag":"p","text":"\"IX - um do Ministério do Desenvolvimento Regional;\"","html":"\"<em>IX - um do Ministério do Desenvolvimento Regiona</em>l;\"","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-16","kind":"annotation","tag":"p","text":"\"X - um do Ministério da Mulher, da Família e dos Direitos Humanos; e\"","html":"\"<em>X - um do Ministério da Mulher, da Família e dos Direitos Humanos; e</em>\"","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-17","kind":"annotation","tag":"p","text":"\"XI - um da Secretaria de Governo da Presidência da República.\"","html":"\"<em>XI - um da Secretaria de Governo da Presidência da República</em>.\"","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-18","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶4̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶C̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶s̶u̶p̶l̶e̶n̶t̶e̶,̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶s̶u̶b̶s̶t̶i̶t̶u̶i̶r̶á̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶s̶u̶a̶s̶ ̶a̶u̶s̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶i̶m̶p̶e̶d̶i̶m̶e̶n̶t̶o̶s̶.̶","html":"<strong>A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶4̶.̶º̶</strong> ̶ ̶C̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶s̶u̶p̶l̶e̶n̶t̶e̶,̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶s̶u̶b̶s̶t̶i̶t̶u̶i̶r̶á̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶s̶u̶a̶s̶ ̶a̶u̶s̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶i̶m̶p̶e̶d̶i̶m̶e̶n̶t̶o̶s̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-19","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶5̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶s̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶r̶e̶s̶p̶e̶c̶t̶i̶v̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶u̶p̶l̶e̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶i̶n̶d̶i̶c̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶i̶t̶u̶l̶a̶r̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶ó̶r̶g̶ã̶o̶s̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶t̶a̶m̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶i̶g̶n̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶h̶e̶f̶e̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶.̶ ̶P̶a̶r̶á̶g̶r̶a̶f̶o̶ ̶ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶.̶ ̶ ̶I̶n̶c̶u̶m̶b̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶h̶e̶f̶e̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶i̶g̶n̶a̶r̶ ̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶d̶o̶r̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶,̶ ̶e̶s̶c̶o̶l̶h̶i̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶s̶ ̶r̶e̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶t̶a̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶t̶r̶a̶t̶a̶ ̶o̶ ̶i̶n̶c̶i̶s̶o̶ ̶I̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶p̶u̶t̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶3̶.̶º̶.̶","html":"<strong>A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶5̶.̶º̶</strong> ̶ ̶O̶s̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶r̶e̶s̶p̶e̶c̶t̶i̶v̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶u̶p̶l̶e̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶i̶n̶d̶i̶c̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶i̶t̶u̶l̶a̶r̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶ó̶r̶g̶ã̶o̶s̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶t̶a̶m̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶i̶g̶n̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶p̶e̶l̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶h̶e̶f̶e̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶.̶<br>\n<strong>̶P̶a̶r̶á̶g̶r̶a̶f̶o̶ ̶ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶</strong>.̶ ̶ ̶I̶n̶c̶u̶m̶b̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶M̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶E̶s̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶h̶e̶f̶e̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶a̶s̶a̶ ̶C̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶e̶s̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶R̶e̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶i̶g̶n̶a̶r̶ ̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶d̶o̶r̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶,̶ ̶e̶s̶c̶o̶l̶h̶i̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶s̶ ̶r̶e̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶t̶a̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶t̶r̶a̶t̶a̶ ̶o̶ ̶i̶n̶c̶i̶s̶o̶ ̶I̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶p̶u̶t̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶3̶.̶º̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-20","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶6̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶u̶n̶i̶r̶á̶,̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶c̶a̶r̶á̶t̶e̶r̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶o̶,̶ ̶m̶e̶n̶s̶a̶l̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶e̶,̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶c̶a̶r̶á̶t̶e̶r̶ ̶e̶x̶t̶r̶a̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶o̶,̶ ̶s̶e̶m̶p̶r̶e̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶v̶o̶c̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶d̶o̶r̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶s̶o̶l̶i̶c̶i̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶m̶í̶n̶i̶m̶o̶,̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶ç̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶s̶.̶","html":"<strong>A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶6̶.̶º̶</strong> ̶ ̶O̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶u̶n̶i̶r̶á̶,̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶c̶a̶r̶á̶t̶e̶r̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶o̶,̶ ̶m̶e̶n̶s̶a̶l̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶e̶,̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶c̶a̶r̶á̶t̶e̶r̶ ̶e̶x̶t̶r̶a̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶o̶,̶ ̶s̶e̶m̶p̶r̶e̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶v̶o̶c̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶d̶o̶r̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶s̶o̶l̶i̶c̶i̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶p̶o̶r̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶m̶í̶n̶i̶m̶o̶,̶ ̶u̶m̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶ç̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶s̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-21","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶7̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶ ̶q̶u̶ó̶r̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶u̶n̶i̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶é̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶m̶a̶i̶o̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶a̶b̶s̶o̶l̶u̶t̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶q̶u̶ó̶r̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶v̶o̶t̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶é̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶m̶a̶i̶o̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶s̶i̶m̶p̶l̶e̶s̶.̶ ̶P̶a̶r̶á̶g̶r̶a̶f̶o̶ ̶ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶.̶ ̶ ̶A̶l̶é̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶v̶o̶t̶o̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶o̶,̶ ̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶d̶o̶r̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶o̶ ̶v̶o̶t̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶q̶u̶a̶l̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶c̶a̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶e̶m̶p̶a̶t̶e̶.̶","html":"<strong>A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶7̶.̶º̶</strong> ̶ ̶O̶ ̶q̶u̶ó̶r̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶u̶n̶i̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶é̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶m̶a̶i̶o̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶a̶b̶s̶o̶l̶u̶t̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶q̶u̶ó̶r̶u̶m̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶v̶o̶t̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶é̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶m̶a̶i̶o̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶s̶i̶m̶p̶l̶e̶s̶.̶<br>\n̶<strong>P̶a̶r̶á̶g̶r̶a̶f̶o̶ ̶ú̶n̶i̶c̶o̶</strong>.̶ ̶ ̶A̶l̶é̶m̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶v̶o̶t̶o̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶o̶,̶ ̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶d̶o̶r̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶o̶ ̶v̶o̶t̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶q̶u̶a̶l̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶c̶a̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶e̶m̶p̶a̶t̶e̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-22","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶8̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶ ̶C̶o̶o̶r̶d̶e̶n̶a̶d̶o̶r̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶S̶o̶l̶i̶d̶a̶r̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶m̶b̶a̶t̶e̶ ̶à̶ ̶C̶o̶v̶i̶d̶-̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶a̶o̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶s̶ ̶E̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶S̶o̶c̶i̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶E̶c̶o̶n̶ô̶m̶i̶c̶o̶s̶ ̶p̶o̶d̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶v̶i̶d̶a̶r̶ ̶e̶s̶p̶e̶c̶i̶a̶l̶i̶s̶t̶a̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶p̶r̶e̶s̶e̶n̶t̶a̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶ó̶r̶g̶ã̶o̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶i̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶s̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶p̶r̶i̶v̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶o̶r̶g̶a̶n̶i̶z̶a̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶c̶i̶v̶i̶l̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶a̶ ̶p̶a̶r̶t̶i̶c̶i̶p̶a̶r̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶s̶u̶a̶s̶ ̶r̶e̶u̶n̶i̶õ̶e̶s̶